0..47 Comment "// This source shows rule witnesses in a model."
48..50 Comment "//"
51..131 Comment "// A rule of a theory is a cell that conversion decides. A model witnesses it by"
132..208 Comment "// a path in its carrier, since a `Path` is a cell that a program carries. A"
209..285 Comment "// model gives one path witness for each theory rule. `ByLeft` and `ByRight`"
286..336 Comment "// use different witnesses for the left unit rule."
337..339 Comment "//"
340..414 Comment "// The checker accepts `Path.here` when the rule sides convert. The kernel"
415..495 Comment "// checks an explicit path when the sides remain distinct. The presented type is"
496..552 Comment "// the initial model, where each witness is `Path.here`."
553..555 Comment "//"
556..588 Comment "// - see: model-ascription.gandr"
589..615 Comment "// - see: model-laws.gandr"
